invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont.c
catches: rsa_avx2_model_test
reason: rsa_vp1_cpu hands rsa_avx2_public sig 2^(Dn - 64) mod m in place of
  sig 2^(Dn) mod m, so base_times_power_of_two_mod runs one step short and
  the chain starts from sig R' / 2^64 where it needs sig R'.
  bin/rsa_avx2_model_test compares rsa_vp1_cpu under CH_CPU_AVX2 with
  rsa_vp1 at every word count.

--- old
        base_times_power_of_two_mod(power, sig, n_len, &mod, rsa_avx2_r_exponent(k));
--- new
        base_times_power_of_two_mod(power, sig, n_len, &mod, rsa_avx2_r_exponent(k) - 64);
